IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SORTDEMO.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "in.dat".
    SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO "out.dat".
    SELECT MERGE-A ASSIGN TO "a.dat".
    SELECT MERGE-B ASSIGN TO "b.dat".
    SELECT WORK-FILE ASSIGN TO "work.tmp".
    SELECT MERGE-FILE ASSIGN TO "merge.tmp".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD IN-FILE.
01 IN-REC PIC X(80).
FD OUT-FILE.
01 OUT-REC PIC X(80).
FD MERGE-A.
01 A-REC PIC X(80).
FD MERGE-B.
01 B-REC PIC X(80).
SD WORK-FILE.
01 WORK-REC.
    05 WORK-KEY PIC X(10).
    05 WORK-DATA PIC X(70).
SD MERGE-FILE.
01 MERGE-REC.
    05 MERGE-KEY PIC X(10).
    05 MERGE-DATA PIC X(70).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-REC PIC X(80).
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE "N".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    SORT WORK-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY WORK-KEY
        USING IN-FILE
        GIVING OUT-FILE.
    SORT WORK-FILE
        ON DESCENDING KEY WORK-KEY WORK-DATA
        WITH DUPLICATES IN ORDER
        COLLATING SEQUENCE NATIVE-SEQ
        INPUT PROCEDURE GET-INPUT THROUGH GET-INPUT-EXIT
        OUTPUT PROCEDURE PUT-OUTPUT.
    MERGE MERGE-FILE ON ASCENDING KEY MERGE-KEY
        USING MERGE-A MERGE-B
        GIVING OUT-FILE.
    MERGE MERGE-FILE
        ASCENDING KEY MERGE-KEY
        USING MERGE-A MERGE-B
        OUTPUT PROCEDURE PUT-OUTPUT.
    STOP RUN.
GET-INPUT.
    RELEASE WORK-REC FROM WS-REC.
    RELEASE WORK-REC.
GET-INPUT-EXIT.
    EXIT.
PUT-OUTPUT.
    RETURN WORK-FILE RECORD INTO WS-REC
        AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END DISPLAY WS-REC
    END-RETURN.
    RETURN MERGE-FILE
        AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF.
